cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Property Opportunity Map: an open spatial forecasting system for European housing"
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/techpolicycomms/property-opportunity-map"
abstract: >-
  An open, reproducible, point-in-time spatial forecasting system that
  identifies affordable European locations likely to outperform their
  national housing market over 5-20 year horizons, combining transaction
  data, accessibility change, demographics, supply constraints and risk.
